1
00:00:00,114 --> 00:00:03,554
(Penny:)Sheldon, you big weirdo. I want you
to know I love that you're in my life.

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:05,910
(Sheldon:)I love you too.

3
00:00:15,028 --> 00:00:20,488
Hello, is this the Bruce Miller
who wrote the season finale of Alphas?

4
00:00:21,335 --> 00:00:25,325
Oh, smashing. You already sound nicer
than the last Bruce Miller...

5
00:00:25,539 --> 00:00:30,169
(Sheldon:)...who suggested I have sexual relations
with myself. Now, down to business.

6
00:00:30,377 --> 00:00:32,247
(Sheldon:)Your show ended on a cliffhanger.

7
00:00:32,479 --> 00:00:35,539
(Sheldon:)Could you please tell me
how you planned to resolve it?

8
00:00:35,716 --> 00:00:37,416
(Sheldon:)Uh-huh.

9
00:00:37,584 --> 00:00:38,914
(Sheldon:)Mm-hm.

10
00:00:39,686 --> 00:00:41,586
(Sheldon:)I see.

11
00:00:41,755 --> 00:00:45,815
(Sheldon:)Well, that all stinks.
No wonder you got canceled. Bye.

12
00:00:46,693 --> 00:00:48,353
(Leonard:)Ah.

